> [K]iehl's Hydro[-Pl]umping Re-Text[urizing] Serum Concentrate[ -] 1.7 oz.
It takes more than chugging a glass of water to[ bring] life back to dehydrated skin. Fortunately, this concentrated serum was created specifically to revive the driest of skin, reversing age-related dehydration that causes fine lines and rough texture. A potent blend of plant-based glycer[in] and Japanese shiso leaf extract plumps skin and soft[ens fine] lines so skin looks healthy, hydrated, and restored.
Great texture! Went on and soaked in like gel[-]water and kept[ my] face hydrated and smooth all day. Loved it, will definitely purchase.
